v1.3.0 (2026-05-11)
-------------------
- User self-registration via email invite
- Registration page (/register?token=...): one-click cert generation, .p12
  and .ovpn download
- Token lifecycle: pending → activated → used
- Resend invite from Edit User modal
- User email stored in user_meta.json
- vpnweb Settings: SMTP config, registration settings (token expiry, base URL)

